    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- Ki +4 and ATK & DEF 300%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of\nbecoming a Super Attack\n- Great chance of evading enemy's attack\n- Great chance of performing a critical hit\n*When there is another \"Movie Bosses\" or \"Storied Figures\"\nCategory ally attacking in the same turn*\n- Attacks are effective against all Types\n- {passiveImg:once}Chance of evading enemy's attack 15%{passiveImg:up_g} for 4 turns\n*When attacking*\n- ATK 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When receiving an attack*\n- DEF 150%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*As the 1st attacker in a turn*\n- ATK & DEF 150%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*After receiving or evading an attack*\n- {passiveImg:forever}Launches an additional Super Attack\n*For every attack evaded*\n- Chance of performing a critical hit & chance of evading\nenemy's attack 10%{passiveImg:up_g} within the turn\n*Every time the character evades 3 or more attacks in battle*\n- Evades enemy's attack within the character's next attacking turn",
